exit: 1
-- SYNTAX ----------------- errors/module_keyword_1.march

`module` is spelled `mod` in March: [module_keyword]

1 | module Main do
    ^^^^^^

    mod Name do
        ...
    end

    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

1 - module Main do
1 + mod Main do

    run `march --explain module_keyword`

after fix: exit 0
